(7483088, 1190431, 98565, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon!<br/>This is really a perfect moment frozen in your picture. I guess in your situation I would have messed up and the shot would have been the wrong exposure and all blurry or somewhat like that...<br/>Did you consider cropping on the top and the right to get rid of the wire mesh fence?</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon!This is really a perfect moment frozen in your picture. I guess in your situation I would have messed up and the shot would have been the wrong exposure and all blurry or somewhat like that...Did you consider cropping on the top and the right to get rid of the wire mesh fence?', '2016-11-18 00:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
